<LocationLayout slug="seaforth">

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container pillar-detail__wrap">
      <div class="loc-prose">
        <h2>Plumbing and heating in Seaforth</h2>
        <p>Seaforth is a historic main-street town southeast of Goderich, known for its preserved Victorian streetscape and a mix of older heritage homes and newer builds on the outskirts. That range is exactly the kind of work a plumbing, heating, and cooling shop sees every day.</p>
        <p>On the heritage side, the older homes often need exactly the work we specialize in: drain and sewer cleaning and camera inspection on original lines, water supply repipes, service and replacement of aging furnaces and boilers, and water heater upgrades. On the newer side, it is new-construction rough-ins, renovations, and the high-efficiency equipment modern builds call for.</p>
        <p>Seaforth is close to our Goderich shop, so scheduling routine work is straightforward, and the 24-hour emergency line covers no-heat and plumbing emergencies there the same as everywhere else we serve in Huron County.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</LocationLayout>
